# Mirage (public repo) environment example
#
# Policy:
# - NEVER commit real `.env` files.
# - `.env` and `.env.*` are gitignored.
# - Prefer the authoritative templates in `deploy/templates/*.env.example`.
#
# Runtime env files (Docker / deploy scripts) are typically placed at:
#   ~/.mirage/config/backend.env
#   ~/.mirage/config/frontend.env
#   ~/.mirage/config/indexer.env
#   ~/.mirage/config/node.env
#
# Copy these templates and fill in values:
#   deploy/templates/backend.env.example
#   deploy/templates/frontend.env.example
#   deploy/templates/indexer.env.example
#   deploy/templates/node.env.example
#
# Referrals tooling (optional):
#   referrals/.env.example
